  "entry": "code/radiowriter/app.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Build and run PubMed searches for an imaging topic, rank the hits by journal rank or citations, save and screen them into named reading lists, then draft a structured Radiopaedia article that cites PMIDs, lint it and export numbered references and HTML. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
